      "canonicalUrl": "/blog/what-is-bio-pur-memory-foam",
      "ogTitle": "Bio-Pur Memory Foam: Formulation, Cooling, Certification",
      "ogDescription": "An editorial look at Amerisleep's Bio-Pur foam: which petroleum content the plant oils replace, how the cell structure shifts, and what stays the same.",
