      "metaTitle": "Mattress Off-Gassing: Is It Dangerous? | The Mattress Digest",
      "metaDescription": "Off-gassing is the VOC release that gives a new mattress its smell. Here is what causes it, what CertiPUR-US limits, and how long the odor usually lasts.",
      "canonicalUrl": "/blog/what-is-off-gassing-and-is-it-dangerous",
