            "Back sleepers usually want medium firmness that supports the lumbar curve without excess hip sinkage.",
            "Stomach sleepers typically need a firmer surface so the midsection does not sink and arch the lower back.",
            "Heavier body weights generally need firmer support to avoid bottoming out into misalignment.",
            "No single mattress firmness produces neutral alignment across every sleep position and body type."
