          "question": "How can I tell whether my mattress supports neutral alignment?",
          "answer": "Check whether your lower back has support without a visible gap, which suggests too firm, and whether your hips are sinking excessively, which suggests too soft. Persistent stiffness that eases on a different bed is another sign that your current mattress may not support neutral alignment for your body."
