          "content": "Sleeping hot is a reason to put airflow ahead of deep contouring when you compare models. A hybrid with a pocketed coil base generally handles heat better than a dense traditional memory foam mattress, and so does an all-foam build using open-cell, plant-based foam, which is what the Amerisleep AS6 does with its Bio-Pur comfort layer and Refresh Cooling Cover. Do not overlook the rest of the setup. Breathable natural-fiber sheets and a cooler bedroom make a meaningful difference next to whatever the mattress contributes.",
