      "title": "What Sleep Debt Is and How to Repay It",
      "metaTitle": "What Sleep Debt Is and How to Repay It | The Mattress Digest",
      "metaDescription": "Sleep debt builds gradually from days or weeks of insufficient rest, and repaying it takes consistent extra sleep rather than one long catch-up night.",
      "canonicalUrl": "/blog/what-is-sleep-debt-and-how-to-repay-it",
      "ogTitle": "What Sleep Debt Is and How to Repay It",
