      "metaTitle": "Reducing Motion Transfer in a Shared Bed | The Mattress Digest",
      "metaDescription": "An all-foam mattress absorbs a partner's movement instead of transmitting it, and a solid foundation and separate bedding cut shared-bed disturbance further.",
      "canonicalUrl": "/blog/how-to-reduce-motion-transfer-in-a-shared-bed",
      "ogTitle": "Cutting Down on Motion Transfer When You Share a Bed",
      "ogDescription": "Why mattress construction drives motion transfer more than anything, plus the frame, bedding, and layout choices that help two sleepers disturb each other less.",
