            "Don't let the off-season layer go unwashed or hard to reach; a duvet buried in the back of a closet is easy to skip on a cold night.",
            "Don't assume adding layers always means more warmth; a layer with poor breathability can trap heat unevenly and feel worse than a single well-chosen blanket."
