          "content": "A guest bedroom poses a different design problem than a primary bedroom. Instead of optimizing for one person's known preferences, it needs to work reasonably well for whoever happens to be staying, often with little advance notice of their sleep habits. That calls for choices that split the difference rather than choices that are ideal for any one sleeper.",
