          "content": "Arthritis can make certain sleep positions genuinely painful, and mornings stiff, especially when a joint is left unsupported or under pressure for hours at a stretch. The suggestions below are general comfort guidance, not medical advice — arthritis is a medical condition that should be diagnosed and managed by a doctor or rheumatologist.",
