          "content": "A mattress that's too firm creates hard pressure points right at arthritic joints, and that can worsen morning stiffness. A softer, deep-contouring surface that cushions the hips, shoulders, and other pressure points tends to be more comfortable for arthritis. The Amerisleep AS5 is a soft-leaning (3/10) mattress built with this kind of joint-pressure relief in mind. It's a reasonable option to consider, though a supporting recommendation, not a treatment.",
