          "question": "Is it really necessary to keep the same sleep schedule on weekends?",
          "answer": "Yes, it makes a real difference. A large gap between weekday and weekend sleep timing makes it harder for the body to settle into a stable rhythm, and that can undercut everything else the routine is doing."
