          "headingLevel": 2,
          "content": "Before buying, read the trial terms for the specific model under consideration rather than assuming every mattress from a brand shares the same policy. Amerisleep's trial period for the AS3, for example, spells out its break-in requirement and return process directly on the product page — the kind of detail worth checking for any brand before committing, since the difference between a smooth return and a frustrating one usually comes down to these specific terms rather than the headline trial length.",
