      "metaDescription": "Memory foam contouring depends mainly on density and response speed, and deeper contouring generally trades pressure relief against ease of changing positions.",
      "canonicalUrl": "/blog/memory-foam-contouring-explained",
      "ogTitle": "What Actually Drives Memory Foam Contouring: A Complete Guide",
      "ogDescription": "An editorial look at how foam density and response speed shape memory foam contouring, and the trade-off between pressure relief and ease of movement.",
      "ogImage": "/images/mattresses/amerisleep-as5.webp",
      "category": "sleep-science",
