          "heading": "How to Use This When Comparing Mattresses",
          "headingLevel": 2,
          "content": "A mattress can't influence cortisol directly, but a comfortable, supportive sleep surface removes one more source of friction when falling asleep is already a struggle because of stress. A model like the Amerisleep AS5 is a reasonable part of an overall wind-down routine, alongside stress management and consistent sleep timing — though it isn't a substitute for addressing chronic stress itself, and persistent sleep disruption is worth raising with a doctor.",
